{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51525","headline":"题惠山寺诗（幷序） 读惠山若冰师诗集因题古院（一作「故园」）五首（前三首《全唐诗》已收） 二 · 李隲","name":"题惠山寺诗（幷序） 读惠山若冰师诗集因题古院（一作「故园」）五首（前三首《全唐诗》已收） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻凿洞碑，此立爲冰师。\n意刻山泉解，功深造化疑。\n碧云终一谢，飞锡久无期。\n惆怅人间世，空传乐府词。\n（元《无锡县志》卷四上《辞章咏歌》、又明《弘治无锡县志》二八《词章》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}